 you forget My remembrance, and you used to laugh at them.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":110,"sd":null},{"k":"23:111","t":"Indeed, I have rewarded them this Day for their patient endurance - that they are the attainers [of success].\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":111,"sd":null},{"k":"23:112","t":"[Allāh] will say, \"How long did you remain on earth in number of years?\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":112,"sd":null},{"k":"23:113","t":"They will say, \"We remained a day or part of a day; ask those who enumerate.\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":113,"sd":null},{"k":"23:114","t":"He will say, \"You stayed not but a little - if only you had known.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":114,"sd":null},{"k":"23:115","t":"Then did you think that We created you uselessly and that to Us you would not be returned?\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":115,"sd":null},{"k":"23:116","t":"So exalted is Allāh, the Sovereign, the Truth; there is no deity except Him, Lord of the Noble Throne.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":116,"sd":null},{"k":"23:117","t":"And whoever invokes besides Allāh another deity for which he has no proof - then his account is only with his Lord. Indeed, the disbelievers will not succeed.","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":117,"sd":null},{"k":"23:118","t":"And, [O Muḥammad], say, \"My Lord, forgive and have mercy, and You are the best of the merciful.\"","j":18,"h":35,"s":23,"a":118,"sd":null}],"juz":18,"hizb":35,"surahs":[23],"sajdah":false}